1
00:00:02,919 --> 00:00:04,039
Why are you coming together?

2
00:00:04,129 --> 00:00:05,505
I have a something to say.

3
00:00:06,047 --> 00:00:07,047
Gather up, everyone!

4
00:00:10,135 --> 00:00:11,761
Did we do something wrong?

5
00:00:12,095 --> 00:00:13,095
It's scary, man.

6
00:00:13,263 --> 00:00:13,847
No.

7
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,265
I did something wrong.

8
00:00:15,432 --> 00:00:16,230
Something wrong?

9
00:00:16,306 --> 00:00:17,306
First of all

10
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:18,350
I want to thank you

11
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,811
for focusing on training.

12
00:00:20,645 --> 00:00:21,645
But

13
00:00:22,147 --> 00:00:23,565
there is a bad news.

14
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,484
The equipment
we have here now

15
00:00:26,693 --> 00:00:28,028
needs to be returned.

16
00:00:28,445 --> 00:00:28,820
What?

17
00:00:29,029 --> 00:00:30,029
What do you mean?

18
00:00:30,447 --> 00:00:31,656
These equipments

19
00:00:31,781 --> 00:00:33,867
are all from
the Principal's support.

20
00:00:34,325 --> 00:00:36,119
Why would he support us?

21
00:00:36,828 --> 00:00:37,828
I asked him

22
00:00:37,996 --> 00:00:39,205
to help our team.

23
00:00:40,498 --> 00:00:41,498
But in return

24
00:00:41,708 --> 00:00:43,960
I had to clean up all
the bathrooms in school.

25
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,879
Why did you agree
to do that?

26
00:00:46,171 --> 00:00:48,590
At first I though
it was for the team

27
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:49,609
but I figured out

28
00:00:50,008 --> 00:00:51,008
that it wasn't

29
00:00:51,301 --> 00:00:53,053
I think I was a bit scared.

30
00:00:53,845 --> 00:00:54,845
When I saw

31
00:00:54,929 --> 00:00:56,306
all the dirt you guys had

32
00:00:56,514 --> 00:00:58,516
on your uniforms every day

33
00:00:59,517 --> 00:01:00,769
I realized we don't need this.

34
00:01:01,436 --> 00:01:02,436
So that is why

35
00:01:02,604 --> 00:01:04,284
I would like to return
all these equipment.

36
00:01:04,813 --> 00:01:05,522
Would that be okay?

37
00:01:05,732 --> 00:01:06,941
If we don't have gloves

38
00:01:07,192 --> 00:01:08,818
we can catch balls
with our bare hands.

39
00:01:09,194 --> 00:01:10,487
Then let's do it ourselves.

40
00:01:10,487 --> 00:01:12,072
Let's do it!

41
00:01:12,072 --> 00:01:12,947
We can do it, you know!

42
00:01:12,947 --> 00:01:13,490
Let's go!

43
00:01:13,490 --> 00:01:14,490
Thank you.

44
00:01:14,824 --> 00:01:15,992
Then Taehun and I

45
00:01:16,117 --> 00:01:17,410
will return these.

46
00:01:17,410 --> 00:01:18,450
Start training without us.

47
00:01:18,661 --> 00:01:19,329
Yeah!

48
00:01:19,329 --> 00:01:19,913
Let's do it!

49
00:01:20,288 --> 00:01:20,747
Let's go!

50
00:01:20,872 --> 00:01:21,998
Let's go!

51
00:01:22,082 --> 00:01:23,082
We got this!
